## Stop decision

The inherited Todo 21 preflight's missing Windows client is reproduced by this task's
fresh read-only probe. The active Linux service and pinned source alone do not establish
the required heartbeat-valid session. Per the task instruction, the run stopped at
preflight instead of simulating a client or mutating PipeWire. Todo 23 cannot be checked,
and the commit message `test(e2e): verify Linux capture-retry on real host` must not be used.

